| Account                | Symbol | Shares | Price    | PriceAsOf  |
| Assets:Brokerage:VTSAX | VTSAX  | 100    | 100.0000 | 2024-03-01 |
| Assets:IRA:VTSAX       | VTSAX  | 50     | 100.0000 | 2024-03-01 |
Given transactions are : Transaction
| Ref | SourceAccount          | Date       | Destination             | Amount   |
| T1  | Assets:Brokerage:VTSAX | 2024-03-01 | Equity:Opening Balances | 10000.00 |
| T2  | Assets:IRA:VTSAX       | 2024-03-01 | Equity:Opening Balances | 5000.00  |
When price recorded : PriceEntry Vertical
| Symbol | VTSAX      |
| Price  | 110.0000   |
| AsOf   | 2024-06-28 |
Then transactions created are : Transaction
| Ref | SourceAccount          | Date       | Destination                 | Amount  |
| T3  | Assets:Brokerage:VTSAX | 2024-06-28 | Equity:Market Value Changes | 1000.00 |
| T4  | Assets:IRA:VTSAX       | 2024-06-28 | Equity:Market Value Changes | 500.00  |

