# Left $WIP: there is no "Given transactions are" of any kind in this scenario
# (neither a real table nor "as previous"), so the ledger holds zero
# transactions when "dividend recorded" runs and the new transaction becomes
# T1 -- but the Then table below names it T5, which only makes sense if four
# transactions already existed. Ref numbering is otherwise exactly "T" plus
# one more than however many transactions already exist (confirmed by every
# other scenario in this file that creates a new transaction), so T5 here
# cannot be produced from what this scenario actually gives. Spelling out
# four prior transactions, or changing the Then table's Ref to T1, is a
# decision for the spec's author, not a glue fix.
