Scenario A dividend paid in cash is income
Description Dividends and interest are income and belong in an income report,
# because they are taxable and because the question of how much the
# investments paid is worth answering. Only the market movement is
# kept out of that report.
Given the chart of accounts is as previous
Given holdings are as previous
When dividend recorded : IncomeEntry Vertical
