| Date     | 2024-06-30             |
| Symbol   | VTSAX                  |
| Amount   | 250.00                 |
| Category | Income:Dividends       |
| Reinvest | false                  |
Then transactions are : Transaction
| Ref | SourceAccount         | Date       | Destination      | Amount |
| T5  | Assets:Brokerage:Cash | 2024-06-30 | Income:Dividends | 250.00 |

Attributes IncomeEntry
| Attribute | Type        | Default    |
| Account   | AccountPath |            |
| Date      | Date        | 2024-01-01 |
| Symbol    | Symbol      |            |
| Amount    | Money       | 0.00       |
| Category  | AccountPath |            |
